g laughs tail and  wampie  why is that I think what this clearly  tells us is that buggy has at least a  good idea what the one piece is all  about and even though there's nothing he  loves more than finding treasure he  doesn't want anything to do with it  I think the clear explanation for that  is that the one piece at its core has  nothing to do with gold or silver is it  possible that there are some piles of  jewelry hoarded on laughs tale sure but  bogey seems to know that the true value  of the one piece lies with something  else something that carries such heavy  implication and consequences that any  sort of material a dance would kind of  lose their meaning as whitebeard stated  finding the one piece will shake the  world to its core and while buggy truly  has developed as a character I think  taking on the consequences of  discovering Rajas treasure is something  that only very few people could do after  all buggy shows us really well what  treasure means to different people he  even talks about this with shanks on  board of the hora Jackson for buggy it  means gold and silver but for shanks it  means something more than that  similar like to Roger the one piece will  be something with a unique meaning just  for him and like his jaw head has a  special meaning to Luffy so there you  have it  buggy actually teaches us a lot about  one piece and I think the way things are  going at the moment we can say for  certain that he will become relevant to  the story again soon I hope you guys  enjoyed this video make sure to smash  that like button for a fresh video next  week and subscribe if you aren't already  part of the crew also let me know your  title for buggy that's better than the  clown and I'll present the best one or  two ideas in the next video if you want  to learn more about the characters in  one piece you can simply click here to  keep watching in whatever comfortable  position you're in right now otherwise I  see you around next time and until the